    "Every inverter manufacturer has their own monitoring portal: Huawei has FusionSolar, Sungrow has iSolarCloud, SMA has Sunny Portal, and so on. If you manage a diverse portfolio, you are constantly switching between platforms, dealing with inconsistent data formats, and manually consolidating reports.": "Cada fabricante de inversores tiene su propio portal: Huawei tiene FusionSolar, Sungrow tiene iSolarCloud, SMA tiene Sunny Portal, etc. Si gestionas una cartera diversa, cambias constantemente entre plataformas, lidias con formatos inconsistentes y consolidas informes manualmente.",
