    "AMMP puts an AI coworker on top of AMMP OS to work across 30+ device brands, including Growatt. That means you can monitor your entire portfolio, Growatt sites, Huawei sites, SMA sites, all in one platform with consistent reporting and analytics.": "AMMP es agnóstico al hardware e integra 30+ marcas incluida Growatt. Supervisa toda tu cartera en una sola plataforma con informes y analítica coherentes.",
