    "AMMP puts an AI coworker on top of AMMP OS to work across 30+ device brands, including SMA. That means you can monitor your entire portfolio, SMA sites, Huawei sites, Sungrow sites, all in one platform with consistent reporting and analytics.": "AMMP es agnóstico al hardware e integra 30+ marcas incluida SMA. Puedes supervisar toda tu cartera, sitios SMA, Huawei, Sungrow, en una sola plataforma con informes y analítica coherentes.",
    "AMMP puts an AI coworker on top of AMMP OS to work across 30+ device brands, including SolarEdge. That means you can monitor your entire portfolio, SolarEdge sites, Huawei sites, SMA sites, all in one platform with consistent reporting and analytics.": "AMMP es agnóstico al hardware e integra 30+ marcas incluida SolarEdge. Supervisa toda tu cartera en una sola plataforma con informes y analítica coherentes.",
