    "AMMP OS brings monitoring, alerting, ticketing, reporting, commercials and integrations into one platform. AMMP AI runs on top of it.": "AMMP OS unifica monitoreo, alertas, gestión de tickets, informes, aspectos comerciales e integraciones en una sola plataforma. AMMP AI funciona sobre ella.",
